{"4126350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HERD", "steam_appid": 4126350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>HERD</strong> is a co-op adventure game about shepherding sheep. 1–4 friends play as young shepherds, disguised with wool mustaches, tasked with delivering sheep to distant villages for their father. He definitely should not have trusted kids with this job. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HERD YOUR SHEEP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Your success is their survival. Lead, throw, catch, and lasso your sheep's way to safety.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126350/extras/60870210253b7c5d693a8484a1d02dff.poster.avif?t=1781815173\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126350/extras/60870210253b7c5d693a8484a1d02dff.webm?t=1781815173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126350/extras/60870210253b7c5d693a8484a1d02dff.mp4?t=1781815173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Map out the best route to the next village… or don’t. You’ll probably end up somewhere beautiful anyway.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126350/extras/720fd66e0311c1e4de7da04d79652665.poster.avif?t=1781815173\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126350/extras/720fd66e0311c1e4de7da04d79652665.webm?t=1781815173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126350/extras/720fd66e0311c1e4de7da04d79652665.mp4?t=1781815173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE THE ELEMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Intense winds, rogue lightning strikes,  angry wildlife, and more threaten you and your sheep.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126350/extras/7ac37c7cca93992c007cb1ea26697ebd.poster.avif?t=1781815173\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126350/extras/7ac37c7cca93992c007cb1ea26697ebd.webm?t=1781815173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126350/extras/7ac37c7cca93992c007cb1ea26697ebd.mp4?t=1781815173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EARN NEW 'STACHES AND FITS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Complete challenges and journeys to  flex new looks. Matching outfits optional but highly encouraged.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126350/extras/e0d22fb55116de3c32699ebecbb31415.poster.avif?t=1781815173\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126350/extras/e0d22fb55116de3c32699ebecbb31415.webm?t=1781815173\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126350/extras/e0d22fb55116de3c32699ebecbb31415.mp4?t=1781815173\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></spa